# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER hardcode real keys in source files)
#
# Quickstart — Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping Only):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Demo Key and paste it below
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has daily limits and supports Maps JS, Places, Routes,
# Geocoding, and Weather APIs. For Air Quality, Pollen, and Solar APIs (or production),
# create and restrict a Google Cloud API key at:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
